---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service & Usage Agreement"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the access and use of newskrypt digital media properties, content syndication, and API guidelines."
  canonicalUrl="https://crypto-news-rose.vercel.app/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <span>📜 Binding Legal Terms & User Agreement</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-black tracking-tight mb-3">
        Terms of Service & Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Effective Date & Formal Notice: September 2026 | newskrypt Publishing & Media Group</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Section 1: Agreement to Terms -->
      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>1. Acceptance of Terms & Conditions</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-black mb-3">
          By accessing, browsing, syndicating, or utilizing the <strong>newskrypt</strong> website, RSS feeds, mobile views, or media assets, you enter into a legally binding agreement to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not accept these provisions in their entirety, you must immediately discontinue access to all <strong>newskrypt</strong> properties.
        </p>
        <p class="text-black">
          These Terms apply globally to all readers, automated scrapers, syndication partners, and corporate entities accessing our digital infrastructure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Intellectual Property, Syndication & SEO Integrity -->
      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-3">2. Intellectual Property, Syndication & Visual Assets</h2>
        <p class="text-black mb-4">
          All articles, investigative reports, technical graphics, analytical tables, custom logo designs, and layout components published on <strong>newskrypt</strong> are protected under international copyright, trademark, and intellectual property laws.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-black text-base mb-1">A. Fair Use Excerpts & Canonical Citation</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              Brief textual excerpts (up to 75 words) may be cited for news commentary or academic reference, provided that clear, explicit, and direct clickable hyperlink attribution is extended to the canonical article URL on <code class="bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-black font-mono border border-slate-300">crypto-news-rose.vercel.app</code>. Full republication or automated scraping without written permission is strictly prohibited.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-black text-base mb-1">B. Image Copyright & Non-Duplication Rules</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              As established in our <a href="/editorial-policy" class="text-amber-600 font-bold hover:underline">Editorial Policy</a>, every article on <strong>newskrypt</strong> features distinct, unique visual assets (1 hero image + up to 2 supporting charts/infographics) with zero image URL re-use across the site. Third parties are forbidden from hotlinking, extracting, or repurposing <strong>newskrypt</strong> image assets without express licensing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: YMYL Disclaimer & Non-Advisory Status -->
      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-3">3. YMYL Financial Disclaimer & Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-black mb-3">
          <strong>newskrypt</strong> is a financial news publication and does not operate as a registered investment advisor, broker-dealer, or financial consultancy:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-black">
          <li><strong>Informational & Educational Purpose Only:</strong> All market analyses, price targets, liquidity breakdowns, and regulatory commentary are provided solely for journalistic and educational purposes. No article constitutes personalized financial, legal, tax, or investment advice.</li>
          <li><strong>No Liability for Market Losses:</strong> In no event shall <strong>newskrypt</strong>, its parent company, officers, journalists, or contributors be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential capital losses, trading liquidations, or smart contract exploits resulting from your reliance on site content.</li>
          <li><strong>Market Volatility Notice:</strong> Digital currencies and crypto derivatives carry high market volatility. You accept full personal responsibility for conducting independent due diligence before allocating capital.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Editorial Standards & Accuracy -->
      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-3">4. Editorial Integrity & Corrections Protocol</h2>
        <p class="text-black mb-3">
          Our newsroom operates under strict standards of factual accuracy, exact headline calibration (55-character title limits and 155-character metaDescription constraints), and transparent corrections:
        </p>
        <p class="text-black">
          If a factual error occurs, it is corrected immediately in accordance with our public <a href="/corrections" class="text-amber-600 font-bold hover:underline">Corrections & Factual Accountability Policy</a>. Readers who identify potential errors are invited to contact our desk at <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-black font-semibold border border-slate-200">newskryptowahrung26@gmail.com</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Governing Law & Contact -->
      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-3">5. Governing Law & Inquiries</h2>
        <p class="text-black">
          These Terms of Service are governed by international commercial and copyright laws. For legal notices, licensing inquiries, or press permissions, contact our legal desk at <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-black font-semibold border border-slate-200">newskryptowahrung26@gmail.com</code> or visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-600 font-bold hover:underline">Contact Desk</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>